Chapter: CdxCodes
  cites Codex chapter Lists

 Central registry of diagnostic codes. Codes are plain integers; call
 sites use the named constants below.

 Ranges: 0xxx infrastructure and lexer; 1xxx parser; 2xxx type checker,
 unifier, codegen; 3xxx name resolver; 4xxx proof and capability;
 9xxx reserved for compiler-internal.

Section: Registry Type
  CdxCodeInfo = record {
    code : Integer between 0 and 65535,
    name : Text,
    severity : Integer between 0 and 3,
    phase : Integer between 0 and 15,
    summary : Text
  }

Section: Infrastructure
  cdx-too-many-errors : Integer = 1

  cdx-resource-exhausted : Integer = 9001

  cdx-deck-overflow : Integer = 9002

  cdx-escape-violation : Integer = 9003

Section: Lexer
  cdx-invalid-tab-escape : Integer = 5

  cdx-invalid-carriage-return-escape : Integer = 6

  cdx-unterminated-text : Integer = 7

